Request:
When piping output into a pager, the CLI still prints progress spinners and colors which corrupt the pager. Example run:

$ mycli list | less
^[[?25l...

We see escape sequences and cursor hide codes. Code currently toggles color based on isatty but not spinners. Spinner implemented in Spinner.cpp:

Spinner::start() {
    hideCursor();
    while (!stopped_) { drawFrame(); std::this_thread::sleep_for(50ms); }
}

